      "period": "1844–1877",
      "status": "ready",
      "summary": "Why the Kansas–Nebraska Act, violence in Kansas, the Dred Scott decision, the Lincoln–Douglas debates, and John Brown's raid failed to settle the question of slavery and ended the old party system."
